# RECIS
### Rural Education in Chemistry, Interactive, in Shona

An offline, interactive voice tutor for ZIMSEC O-Level Chemistry. Works in airplane mode for rural Zimbabwe.

### Meaning
- R - Rural - Built for Zvishavane
- E - Education 
- C - Chemistry - ZIMSEC 5070
- I - Interactive - Speaks and listens
- S - Shona - Mother tongue

Offline Shona voice tutor for rural schools.
